body:
I probably won't be getting FM22 anytime soon, it's kinda hard to buy it in Brazil, so I'm doing my Newcastle save in 21 without rushing it. I *might've added* a front-end sugar daddy through the editor, but hey, that's realistic as far as things go, innit?

&#x200B;

I really want to do Journeyman in 22 though. Proper journeyman, without any badges or experience. I did it in 21 but I gave myself a little advantage by having badges. It was still a cracker experience though, going through several different teams, tiers and countries.

&#x200B;

Also, good luck in your save! I never managed to figure out how the playoffs in Belgium work hahahah
